# Context Model agent context

A local checkout of the Celonis Context Model documentation wiki lives under the **gitignored `reference/` folder** at the root of the knowledge repository:

`reference/context-model-documentation/`  (absolute: `~/docs/reference/context-model-documentation/`)

- **Remote:** https://github.com/celonis/context-model-documentation
- **Purpose:** Directional wiki for the Context Model project (codename `pig-sl`) — vision, architecture, component model, decisions, and observed materials.
- **Reference only.** It has its own independent `.git`, is gitignored by this project, and must not be committed from here.

> Tip: root an agent session at `~/docs` to browse the whole knowledge repository (Literature, Inbox, and this Context Model reference). See `~/docs/README.md`.

## When to use it

Consult this checkout when the task involves Context Model, pig-sl, PI Graph, Perspectives, Functions, Object Types, Event Sources, or related Celonis platform semantics.

Read `reference/context-model-documentation/AGENTS.md` before making substantive changes inside that checkout.

## Orientation (read order)

1. `reference/context-model-documentation/README.md`
2. `reference/context-model-documentation/1-direction-and-vision/`
3. `reference/context-model-documentation/2-architecture/`
4. `reference/context-model-documentation/3-context-model/`
5. `reference/context-model-documentation/4-decisions/`
6. `reference/context-model-documentation/5-observed-materials/`

Do **not** auto-load `y-synthesized-documents/` unless a human explicitly references a file there.

## Updating the checkout

```bash
git -C ~/docs/reference/context-model-documentation pull --ff-only
```
